From affae40510192cc1a0ec84a0f612270411e9a240 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:48:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add drag-to-align underlay plans for stacked storeys

- Any Plan Sheet (structural, reference or underlay) can be underlaid beneath
  the active base sheet, not only sheets that already have a Story
- New StoryAlignOverlay: drag the underlay on the canvas, arrow-key nudge
  (Shift x10, Alt fine), centre-on-base and reset; stored as exact mm adjust
- Per-sheet UnderlayControls in the Plan Sheets panel (toggle, 0-100% opacity,
  align) and an Align button in the Stories panel
- New underlays start centred on the base crop
- Fix overlay opacity being applied twice (squared); now linear
- Base sheet no longer needs a Story for overlays/ghost elements to render
- Add .gitignore for node_modules and dist
